              "text": "Past (I …): ಹಿಂಜರಿದೆ, hiñjaride."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What you shrink from takes the -ಅಲು form: ಕೇಳಲು ಹಿಂಜರಿ (hiñjari), to hesitate to ask."
            }
          ]
        },
