          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂಜರಿ (hiñjari) is native Kannada, built on hin-, \"back, behind\" (DEDR 4205), as in ಹಿಂದೆ; the origin of the second part is not settled. The picture is stepping back."
