              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೊಟ್ಟೆಕಿಚ್ಚು (hoṭṭekiccu) is a native Dravidian compound: hoṭṭe, \"belly\" (DEDR 4494), and kiccu, \"fire\" (DEDR 1514). Envy burns in the stomach."
            }
